{"2782030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knights of Conquest: Feudal Shenanigans Galore", "steam_appid": 2782030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hail, Sir Knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King has bequeathed unto thee royal lands as reward for thy faithful service. However, these lands are untamed, with its subjects rejecting thy rule as if they weren't a part of the kingdom. As a faithful vassal of thy lord, take up thy sword and conquer these lands and bring them under thy rule, as is thy right!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.poster.avif?t=1782380151\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.webm?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.mp4?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your holdings by managing resources and buildings. Each building has a purpose that unlocks greater advantages for your town and for your campaign, whether if it's a simple house for your peasant populations, or a grand marketplace to open up a town to trade and resources that are otherwise not available in the town. Construct walls and defenses to defend your holdings from invaders and develop them in order to bring more resources and manpower for your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.poster.avif?t=1782380151\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.webm?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.mp4?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your own skill as a knight and upgrade your equipment as you progress through your journey as a knight. Whether it be improving your personal martial skills, or increasing your ability to lead bigger retinues, investing in your knight will allow you greater power and ability to conquer other lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/7a25bd462bc1858957ae815cc9896364.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/7a25bd462bc1858957ae815cc9896364.webp?t=1782380151 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and design your units however you want! A heavily armored, high quality soldier requiring the finest equipment? Or maybe just hordes of cheap starving peasants with cheap gear? Or maybe a heavily armored wizard, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Shenanigans</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, or rather all the time, it's more fun to play with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your fellow knights into your game to assist you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up your holdings among your friends, who can in turn help you manage your realm as it grows, and assist you in battle with their own armies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the realm with your knight friends!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hail, Sir Knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King has bequeathed unto thee royal lands as reward for thy faithful service. However, these lands are untamed, with its subjects rejecting thy rule as if they weren't a part of the kingdom. As a faithful vassal of thy lord, take up thy sword and conquer these lands and bring them under thy rule, as is thy right!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.poster.avif?t=1782380151\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.webm?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.mp4?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your holdings by managing resources and buildings. Each building has a purpose that unlocks greater advantages for your town and for your campaign, whether if it's a simple house for your peasant populations, or a grand marketplace to open up a town to trade and resources that are otherwise not available in the town. Construct walls and defenses to defend your holdings from invaders and develop them in order to bring more resources and manpower for your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.poster.avif?t=1782380151\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.webm?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.mp4?t=1782380151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your own skill as a knight and upgrade your equipment as you progress through your journey as a knight. Whether it be improving your personal martial skills, or increasing your ability to lead bigger retinues, investing in your knight will allow you greater power and ability to conquer other lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/7a25bd462bc1858957ae815cc9896364.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/7a25bd462bc1858957ae815cc9896364.webp?t=1782380151 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and design your units however you want! A heavily armored, high quality soldier requiring the finest equipment? Or maybe just hordes of cheap starving peasants with cheap gear? Or maybe a heavily armored wizard, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1782380151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1782380151 width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Shenanigans</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, or rather all the time, it's more fun to play with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your fellow knights into your game to assist you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up your holdings among your friends, who can in turn help you manage your realm as it grows, and assist you in battle with their own armies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the realm with your knight friends!</p>", "short_description": "Become a knight and conquer the lands for your king and yourself! Manage your towns and resources, command your armies and peasants, and maybe even bring your fellow knight friends to assist in your quest. Feudal shenanigans await!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/3e826a29854ba20b721106fbe3092c01c7dd7d1b/header.jpg?t=1782380151", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/74f288bc28f4ade0c73269dad4feb5fc81062958/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782380151", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/74f288bc28f4ade0c73269dad4feb5fc81062958/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782380151", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit, 2 GHz or Faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050 ti<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></